<title>UK: BOE forecasts 550 mln stg shortage, no early help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 550 mln stg shortage, no early help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England did not offer the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 550 million stg.</p>
</text>
